## Real 2027-28 package (4 x 26x33 mm dies at 350 W/cm2 + 16 HBM, 12.85 kW, 15.4 LPM), hottest-die case-to-inlet, zoned
fit from nonuniform-heatmap: dT = 33 + 3500/h_eff + 350 (R_TIM - 0.05); h_eff from the model core at the die-zone flow
- core R, h_eff 126 kW/m2K, paste 0.07: hot-die dT 67.7 K -> Tcase 113 C
- core R, h_eff 126 kW/m2K, PCM 0.055: hot-die dT 62.4 K -> Tcase 107 C
- core R, h_eff 126 kW/m2K, liquid metal 0.015: hot-die dT 48.4 K -> Tcase 93 C
- core R, h_eff 126 kW/m2K, direct-to-die LM (lid+TIM1 removed, ~ -28 K at junction): hot-die dT 48.4 K -> Tcase 93 C
- core P, h_eff 187 kW/m2K, paste 0.07: hot-die dT 58.7 K -> Tcase 104 C
- core P, h_eff 187 kW/m2K, PCM 0.055: hot-die dT 53.5 K -> Tcase 98 C
- core P, h_eff 187 kW/m2K, liquid metal 0.015: hot-die dT 39.5 K -> Tcase 84 C
- core P, h_eff 187 kW/m2K, direct-to-die LM (lid+TIM1 removed, ~ -28 K at junction): hot-die dT 39.5 K -> Tcase 84 C
